    "updated_at": "2022-07-27T18:16:51Z",
    "body": "Following up here because I want to make sure to provide the right guidance on this for other `UnderlyingSink` implementers. I'm okay with changing the behavior of the Web Serial API in Chromium if the intention is for Streams to eventually support explicitly transfering the buffer to the `UnderlyingSink` and later returning it to the caller. It looks like this is being discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/streams/issues/495 and the summary mentions the current ambiguities.",
